{"nodes": [{"id": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_handoff_152", "label": "HANDOFF-152 - chat 152 to R3", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/HANDOFF-152.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Slim form per RULINGS-R2 chat-127 item 5: the docket, method and conventions live in DOCKET.md, findings in READ-*.md and WORKING-REGISTER.md, deferred items in DEFERRED.md, rulings in RULINGS-R2.md - read all four at open, last blocks first."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_build185", "label": "BUILD185 compendia bundle", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/HANDOFF-152.md", "source_location": "L14-L16", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "6,047,434 B, md5 1a822dfe3dad7d87956275b90892e514, 68,222 lines, 361 members; close.py's reverse guard recovers BUILD184 exactly."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_build90_main", "label": "BUILD90 main and register bundle", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/HANDOFF-152.md", "source_location": "L12-L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "1,983,081 B, md5 49065309b0c4fe8e055f693aed295cca, 18,470 lines, 2 members - unchanged since chat 62."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_chat_67_hold", "label": "The Chat-67 Hold", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/HANDOFF-152.md", "source_location": "L24-L29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Findings are recorded and never repaired; R3 executes. It is why rulings (a), (a) and (b) are seated rather than executed from Cowork - they edit volumes."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_w_190_loop_ruling", "label": "W-190's Loop Ruling", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/HANDOFF-152.md", "source_location": "L26-L29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A Cowork chat opens from Drive, works through Graphify as the substrate for state, and closes by writing small parts back to Drive. It suspends the repo store-of-record route only where GitHub is unreachable, and it is unreachable only from Cowork - so the two rulings are not in conflict."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_member_extraction_regex", "label": "The Member Extraction Regex", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/HANDOFF-152.md", "source_location": "L109-L118", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The body group MUST include its trailing newline: ending it at '\\n<<<END FILE:' truncates EVERY member by exactly one byte and every md5 fails. Chat 152's line-based extractor was cross-checked against the regex on all 363 members with zero disagreements, so either route is byte-exact."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_r3_work_order", "label": "What R3 Owes, In Order", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/HANDOFF-152.md", "source_location": "L52-L86", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Seven items: ruling (c)'s entry, rulings (a)/(a)/(b), 32a-04's restoration entry, 32a-03's docket-38 qualification, 28b-08, and the two open census bodies. No re-derivation is owed - DEF-143 item 11's order is empty and stays empty."}], "edges": [{"source": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_handoff_152", "target": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_build185", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/HANDOFF-152.md", "source_location": "L14", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_handoff_152", "target": "incoming_build185_parts_handoff_152_bui